17c82-6c98-79d1-aa99-aa6f1dc64103\n- rollout_summaries/2026-10-30T01-25-26-OwfP-floor_division_ranking_count_implementation.md — Floor-division/Mobius counting and ranking reconstruction remain proposed, unimplemented, and unverified; thread_id=01a18a69-6891-7e32-a68d-b2e3ad57a505\n\n#### Arknights research\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-10-12T11-21-15-0NtU-arknights_lore_and_mechanics_research_history.md — Detailed Arknights lore, operator-mechanics, roguelike, and NetEase ranking research, with corrections separating verified source material from estimates and player inference; thread_id=01a12fd8-6c2e-79d0-ad7d-1a99f236e032\n  - Us"},{"type":"input_text","text":"e especially for the corrected NetEase same-heat ordering conclusion (retain server return order; public heat/comment counts do not fully explain it), Sui short-judgement-text list and unverified entries, and the caveats around Abyssal/Ægir lore, Clemenssa's non-confirmed Inquisition membership, IS rankings, and Ch'en alter sword-wave terrain interactions.\n\n#### MAA Arknights Assistant\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-10-20T07-17-54-WET2-arknights_copilot_51044_104914_adaptations.md — GO-EX-7 and TW-EX-7 copilot adaptations passed static checks only, not battle tests; thread_id=01a1582c-844c-7c13-b25b-67921b416404\n- rollout_summaries/2026-10-10T02-15-16-kwoj-windows_stalls_maa_amd_gpu_handoff.md — Windows-wide slowdown investigation was explicitly paused; do not resume diagnostics, changes, jobs, or monitoring without “继续排查”; thread_id=01a12397-d9bd-7500-bd9c-9381d3ab30c3\r\n========= MEMORY_SUMMARY ENDS =========\r\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<skills_instructions>\n## Host skills\n\n## Skills\nA skill is a set of local instructions to follow that is stored in a `SKILL.md` file. Below is the list of skills that can be used. Each entry includes a name, description, and a short path that can be expanded into an absolute path using the skill roots table.\n### Skill roots\n- `r0` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/skills/.system`\n- `r1` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-bundled`\n- `r2` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/google-drive/0.1.22/skills`\n- `r3` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/pages/0.1.26/skills`\n- `r4` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote`\n- `r5` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/sites/1.1.3/skills`\n- `r6` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/work-pets/0.1.6/skills`\n- `r7` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-primary-runtime`\n- `r8` = `C:/Users/605/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-primary-runtime/spreadsheets/26.1104.11149/skills`\n### Available skills\n- imagegen: Generate or edit raster images when the task benefits from AI-created bitmap visuals such as photos, illustrations, textures, sprites, mockups, or transparent-background cutouts. Use when Codex should create a brand-new image, transform an existing image, or derive visual variants from references, and the output should be a bitmap asset rather than repo-native code or vector. Do not use when the task is better handled by editing existing SVG/vector/code-native assets, extending an established icon or logo system, or building the visual directly in HTML/CSS/canvas. (file: r0/imagegen/SKILL.md)\n- openai-docs: Use for Codex models/pricing, scheduled tasks, skills, settings, setup, troubleshooting, customization, automations, and self-knowledge—including 'you,' 'your,' 'this app,' or 'this coding agent' when they refer to Codex—and for OpenAI APIs/products and ChatGPT Work. Also use for model choice/migration, prompting, SDKs, Responses, Realtime, agents, evals, and Chat/Work/Codex comparisons. Do not use for generic app/software tasks that merely mention Codex. (file: r0/openai-docs/SKILL.md)\n- skill-creator: Create or update a Codex skill with appropriately scoped instructions and any needed supporting resources. (file: r0/skill-creator/SKILL.md)\n- skill-installer: Install