一个个游戏，不也是大模拟吗？ 一切都会好起来的！ Ade，CCF.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1aae8-cf19-7162-9e82-5a2424bbef01","create_time":1793868786.0145988}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
